sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as SearchPage
  participant API as productApi
  participant R as productRouter
  participant C as productController
  participant M as Product Model
  participant DB as MySQL
  UI->>API: getProducts(filters)
  API->>R: GET /api/products query
  R->>C: getProducts
  C->>C: buildWhere + parsePaging + getOrder
  C->>M: findAndCountAll
  M->>DB: SELECT with filters
  DB-->>C: rows + count
  C-->>UI: products + pagination
